		<unit label="chapter" identifier="15" level="3">Motor Vehicle Dealers</unit>
		<unit label="article" identifier="1" level="4">Motor Vehicle Dealers, Generally</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>46.2-1501</section_number>
	<catch_line>General powers of Commissioner</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Commissioner shall promote the interest of the retail buyers of motor vehicles and endeavor to prevent unfair methods of competition and unfair or deceptive acts or practices.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 46-504; 1958, c. 541, § 46.1-517; 1988, c. 865; 1989, c. 727.</history>
